{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794346901231,"sessionID":"ses_e38b9aa43ffeVjX0mj3j3mxKOi","part":{"id":"prt_1c768ded1001SZcdBrlFYDhlOI","messageID":"msg_1c768913d001oUWZtwkhuCazph","sessionID":"ses_e38b9aa43ffeVjX0mj3j3mxKOi","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794346901231,"sessionID":"ses_e38b9aa43ffeVjX0mj3j3mxKOi","part":{"id":"prt_1c768ded4001LzbRz1R80lnffg","messageID":"msg_1c768913d001oUWZtwkhuCazph","sessionID":"ses_e38b9aa43ffeVjX0mj3j3mxKOi","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a shared customer directory: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` plus React (TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind) frontend, SQLite storage under `./data`, served together on port 8000 via gunicorn from the root `Dockerfile`.\n- Team members register/login (bearer token), see a paged/searchable customer table, a customer page with edit/delete and an interaction log (calls/emails/meetings).\n\n## Important Details\n- API contracts: `POST /api/auth/register` (201) and `POST /api/auth/login` (200 with `{\"token\": ...}`) take `{\"username\", \"password\"}`; requests send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; unauthenticated → 401. `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- Customer object: `id`, `name`, `email`, `phone`, `company`, `notes`, `created_at`, `interaction_count`, `last_contacted_at` (latest interaction's `occurred_at`, else `null`).\n- Interaction object: `id`, `customer_id`, `kind`, `summary`, `occurred_at`, `logged_by`.\n- `GET /api/customers` → `{\"items\", \"total\", \"page\", \"page_size\"}`, sorted by name, query params `q`, `company`, `page`, `page_size`. `GET /api/customers/{id}/interactions` → `{\"items\": [...]}` newest first.\n- `PUT /api/customers/{id}` replaces fields (omitted optional = cleared). `DELETE /api/customers/{id}` deletes customer + interactions. Every signed-in member may read/change everything.\n- Validation errors return JSON `{\"error\", \"message\", \"errors\": {field: msg}}`; duplicate-email message form: `Duplicate email: a customer with the email '<email>' already exists.`\n- Interaction `kind` accepts singular/plural of `call`, `email`, `meeting`; `occurred_at` optional (defaults to now), ISO 8601.\n- Stack layout: `backend/app.py` entry, `backend/requirements.txt` + `backend/requirements.lock` (hash-pinned; update lock when deps change), `frontend/` Vite project (`npm run build` → `frontend/dist`). Backend serves frontend at `/` with SPA fallback.\n- Styling: Tailwind utility classes only (Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`); only Tailwind entry CSS allowed (`frontend/src/index.css`).\n- Docker: node:24-slim builds frontend, python:3.13-slim runs gunicorn `--bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app`; data persists in `/app/data`.\n- Sandbox: no external network except package registries; cannot write outside `/workspace` (e.g. `/tmp` venv denied); local dev venv at `/workspace/.venv` (gitignored via `**/.venv`).\n- Frontend deps installed (exact): react 19.3.1, react-dom 19.3.1, react-router-dom 7.18.5, tailwindcss 4.3.5, @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5, typescript 7.0.2, @types/react 19.3.0, @types/react-dom 19.3.0, vite 8.3.5, @vitejs/plugin-react 6.2.1.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Backend written and smoke-tested: `backend/db.py` (SQLite schema in `data/directory.db`, tables `users`, `tokens`, `customers`, `interactions`, unique NOCASE email index, `occurred_epoch` for ordering) and `backend/app.py` (auth with `secrets.token_urlsafe(32)` tokens, werkzeug password hashing, customers CRUD with paging/search/company filter/duplicate-email check, interactions endpoints, `NotFound`/`BadRequest` error handlers, health + frontend SPA fallback).\n- 53/53 API smoke tests pass (`/workspace/.venv/smoke.py`) covering auth, validation, duplicate email message/field errors, paging, sorting, company filter, PUT clearing optionals, interaction ordering/`last_contacted_at`, delete cascade, 401/404 cases.\n- Server run pattern that works: `setsid /workspace/.venv/bin/gunicorn --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 --pythonpath /workspace/backend --workers 2 --chdir /workspace app:app > /workspace/.venv/server.log 2>&1 < /dev/null & disown` (beware `pkill` matching its own shell).\n- Frontend scaffolding done: `frontend/vite.config.ts` (react + tailwind plugins, `/api` proxy), `frontend/tsconfig.json`, `frontend/index.html`, `frontend/src/index.css`, `frontend/src/types.ts`, `frontend/src/api.ts` (fetch client, `ApiError` with `fields`, token in `localStorage` key `customer-directory.token`, `auth-expired` event on 401), `frontend/src/auth.tsx` (`AuthProvider`, `useAuth`, `RequireAuth`), `frontend/src/ui.tsx` (Alert, Field, TextInput, TextArea, Select, Button, Card, Spinner, formatDate, KIND_LABELS/KIND_STYLES), `frontend/src/components/Layout.tsx`.\n- Pages written: `frontend/src/pages/SignInPage.tsx` (description + sign-in + registration forms), `frontend/src/pages/CustomersPage.tsx` (table, debounced search, company filter, paging, PAGE_SIZE 10), `frontend/src/pages/CustomerFormPage.tsx` (add/edit with per-field API error display).\n\n### Active\n- Frontend remaining pieces: `frontend/src/pages/CustomerDetailPage.tsx` (edit/delete actions, interaction log showing kind/summary/date/logged_by, new-interaction form) and wiring `frontend/src/main.tsx` / `frontend/src/App.tsx` (react-router routes: `/` SignInPage, `/customers`, `/customers/new`, `/customers/:id`, `/customers/:id/edit` under `RequireAuth` + `Layout`, plus `AuthProvider` and `index.css` import).\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write `frontend/src/pages/CustomerDetailPage.tsx` (fetch customer + interactions, edit/delete buttons with confirm, interaction form with kind select/summary/occurred_at datetime, refresh after logging).\n2. Rewrite `frontend/src/App.tsx` with react-router route tree and `AuthProvider`, update `frontend/src/main.tsx` to import `./index.css` and `BrowserRouter`, then `npm run build` and run backend + smoke tests; verify `GET /api/health` and frontend serving from the built image contract.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: full Flask API + static frontend serving; entry for gunicorn `app:app`.\n- `/workspace/backend/db.py`: SQLite schema/helpers (`DATA_DIR` = `./data`, `directory.db`).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt` / `requirements.lock`: pinned deps (flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0); lock is pip constraints.\n- `/workspace/.venv/smoke.py`: 53-case API smoke test suite (run with `/workspace/.venv/bin/python`).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`, `types.ts`, `auth.tsx`, `ui.tsx`: API client, shared types, auth context, UI primitives.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/`: `SignInPage.tsx`, `CustomersPage.tsx`, `CustomerFormPage.tsx` done; `CustomerDetailPage.tsx` still to create.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx`, `App.tsx`: still the starter stubs — need router wiring.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: build/run contract (port 8000, `frontend/dist`, `./data`).","time":{"start":1794346901204,"end":1794346901208}}}
